WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
That's me. That's me.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.400
And that's three people.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.800
And I'm going to help them.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.600
But it has to be something really big.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.200
Something they can't do by themselves.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.900
So I do it for them.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.400
Then they do it for three other people.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.900
That's nine.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.300
And I do three more.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.300
That's twenty-seven.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.100
I'm not really good at math,

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.000
but it gets big really fast.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.400
You know?

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.300
All right, all right, all right.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.000
A little articulation, please.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:52.100
Yes.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.400
I think it's a good idea.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.200
Sean.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.400
It's stupid.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.100
Adam.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.350
It's the honor system.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.750
People blow off the honor system.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.750
So what?

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.200
Just because you do.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.200
Well, Trevor, the class seems to think

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.900
that you've come up with an overly utopian idea.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.000
Look that word up in a minute.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:13.200
Like… a perfect world?

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.200
Mm-hmm.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:17.800
So?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.000
So?

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.000
What put this idea in your head?

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.400
Because… everything sucks?

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.700
He talked to you about this?

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.600
We've had our discussions.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.000
Yeah.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.900
But you don't have to worry, though.

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:43.300
'Cause I'll just… I'll tell him we can't talk no more.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.600
No.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.200
Don't do that.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.200
Would you like a cup of coffee?
